        "The backup strategy follows the 3-2-1 rule: 3 copies of data, on 2 different media types, with 1 copy offsite. Daily incremental backups run at 2:00 AM UTC. Weekly full backups run on Sundays at 4:00 AM UTC. Backup retention is 30 days for daily backups and 1 year for weekly backups.",
